{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50365","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十八、相似树咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十八、相似树咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两树夹招提，三春引影低。\n叶中微有字，阶下已成蹊。\n含气同修短，分条德且齐。\n不容凡鸟坐，应欲俟栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}